<title>JAPAN: Forex movements need to be watched closely -- MITI.</title>
<headline>Forex movements need to be watched closely -- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recent movements in foreign exchange rates have been rapid and they need to be watched closely, Vice Trade Minister Tsutomu Makino said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Asked about the yen's recent rise, Makino said: &quot;It is not for the government to speak of levels. All I can say is that it is necessary to watch the situation closely a little more.&quot;</p>
</text>
